# Flutter/Dart/Pub related
# The repository is a pub workspace and its one lock file (pubspec.lock at the root, covering the
# plugin, the feedback package and the example app) IS committed, so CI and the example builds
# resolve the same versions every run. It is not published: .pubignore drops it.
**/doc/api/
.dart_tool/
.flutter-plugins-dependencies
/build/
/coverage/
